  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">CIUDADANIA: 20 years of political culture and democracy in Bolivia</narrative>
   <narrative xml:lang="SV">CIUDADANIA: 20 &#xe5;r av demokratiutveckling i Bolivia</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">CIUDADANIA is the Bolivian partner of the Latin American Public Opinion Project (LAPOP)which has applied to Sweden for a funding of a maximum of 400 000 SEK, to carry out an analysis of the political culture and democratic values in Bolivia, during the period 1998-2017.</narrative>
   <narrative xml:lang="SV">CIUDADANIA &#xe4;r den bolivianska partnern till det Latinamerikanska Offentliga Opinionsprojektet (LAPOP) som har ans&#xf6;kt om en finansiering p&#xe5; h&#xf6;gst 400 000 kronor f&#xf6;r att utf&#xf6;ra en analys av den demokratiska utvecklingen i Bolivia under perioden 1998 -2017.</narrative>
  </description>
